{
  "_doc": "The character builder (the armoury's CHARACTER tab; the owner, 2026-11-16: \"the face will be heavily customizable in game when the player first starts\"). groups: the tab's list, in order; a face group's sliders are the body's morph targets face_<key> (tools/blender/hero/orion/headcage.FACE_SLIDERS), each -1..1. skinTones and hairColours: linear tints over the body's own maps (the first of each is the default). Read at runtime (SOData; tools/package.sh stages it). A slider shows only on a body that has its morph target (the two bodies' faces were built apart: eye_tilt, lips_full and jaw_width are the female body's). beards: the builder's beards (none = clean-shaven, the base face; the face's beard map's channels, game.py beard_maps) and the bodies whose faces carry them; the hairstyles are the body's wardrobe's hair slot.",
